WEBVTT

00:00:03.050 --> 00:00:05.780
His eyes close into darkness, as death

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:09.570
takes over his mind,
and he denies the entire world.

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.590
And when he thinks of life,

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:14.130
accepting everything, they open.

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:19.590
What he sees... What he chooses...

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:22.070
That is...

00:01:52.510 --> 00:01:57.880
<b>Eleventh Hour: Hirose</b>

00:02:03.090 --> 00:02:04.900
Are you finished?

00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:10.750
Is that all of your anger?

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:14.270
I am the daughter of the Kohinatas...

00:02:16.350 --> 00:02:17.580
The ones...

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:22.950
who ruined this village and your families.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:27.710
As long as I'm here, your hatred will remain.

00:02:27.710 --> 00:02:29.690
As long as there are Kohinatas,

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:33.490
they will bring disaster to this village.

00:02:35.930 --> 00:02:40.400
If you want it that badly, I'll give it to you!

00:02:40.540 --> 00:02:46.920
You should be thankful we even
allow you in the village!

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:48.450
Arrogant, little...

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:50.950
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:58.320
S-Stop it!

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.180
She's going to die!

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:00.280
Shut up!

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:02.990
Hey! What are you doing?

00:03:07.400 --> 00:03:09.620
Are you okay?

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.640
What?

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.300
Kohinata!

00:03:17.240 --> 00:03:20.610
Don't try to do anything for me.

00:03:22.840 --> 00:03:24.360
Kohinata!

00:04:15.540 --> 00:04:16.780
Hirose...

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:22.870
I thought I might find you if I came here.

00:04:22.870 --> 00:04:26.310
I'm sorry for what I said.

00:04:26.310 --> 00:04:30.430
But no, what I wanted to say was...

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:35.720
No more lies.

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:37.010
Lies?

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:39.780
You've been holding back this
whole time, haven't you?

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:42.440
You want to unleash all your
anger at me, right?

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:44.120
No...

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:47.570
It's the Kohinatas' fault your mother died.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:55.590
The Kohinatas drove your mother to suicide.

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.310
Let's not talk about this...

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:03.860
It's not your fault.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:06.320
I'm just like them!

00:05:06.320 --> 00:05:09.520
I'm one of the Kohinatas
who killed your mother!

00:05:11.820 --> 00:05:15.500
All the rage and hate you've held inside...

00:05:16.760 --> 00:05:18.860
Throw it at me!

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:30.410
Your rage at having your mother stolen!

00:05:31.710 --> 00:05:33.040
Now do it!

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:39.280
That's right...

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:46.060
I'll take everything you have...
Before you break.

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:49.720
Stop it!

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:51.030
Stop it!

00:05:51.770 --> 00:05:52.720
Why?

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:54.970
Why did you kill my mother?

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:55.900
Why?

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:58.400
Why?!

00:05:58.400 --> 00:06:00.450
Why?

00:06:07.110 --> 00:06:08.370
Hayami-chan?

00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:13.300
I...

00:06:16.490 --> 00:06:17.860
I...

00:06:30.710 --> 00:06:32.300
What do you mean?

00:06:32.300 --> 00:06:37.380
I said that you may meet with
the Hirose boy as Hotaru.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:42.830
I don't understand what you're thinking.

00:06:42.830 --> 00:06:44.650
But Hirose-sama and Hayami-chan are...

00:06:44.650 --> 00:06:48.150
That will soon come to an end.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.770
You can't come in here!

00:06:57.760 --> 00:06:59.460
Yui-san?

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:00.500
Come with me now.

00:07:09.710 --> 00:07:13.040
That's fine... Stay still.

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:14.800
Where's Hirose?

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:17.650
He's still unconscious.

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:21.850
But the doctors said there's
nothing wrong with his body.

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.720
I see.

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:27.140
Why did this happen?

00:07:27.140 --> 00:07:31.520
It's better that he hates me...

00:07:31.520 --> 00:07:35.790
Then he can live without suffering.

00:07:35.790 --> 00:07:37.100
But...

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:42.240
He can't hate you.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:46.220
Hirose-sama loves you.

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.880
Hayami-chan!

00:07:53.320 --> 00:07:55.100
Hayami-chan!

00:07:59.590 --> 00:08:02.490
Hayami-chan, please don't go!

00:08:02.490 --> 00:08:05.920
My mother's death had nothing to do with you!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:07.800
I know that!

00:08:08.680 --> 00:08:10.730
I know it!

00:08:11.340 --> 00:08:15.030
Then... You have to accept it.

00:08:15.030 --> 00:08:17.220
You have to accept it...

00:08:18.210 --> 00:08:20.410
Everything.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.790
Mother...

00:08:38.460 --> 00:08:39.900
Mother!

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:42.470
Mother!

00:08:52.240 --> 00:08:53.740
You won't catch her.

00:08:53.740 --> 00:08:57.580
As long as you're chasing death,
you can't leave this place.

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:01.090
The mother who left you behind...

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:05.890
The mother who let go of your hand, and left.

00:09:05.890 --> 00:09:09.830
You can't forgive her for that.

00:09:17.760 --> 00:09:18.500
No...

00:09:21.770 --> 00:09:22.940
No...

00:09:26.950 --> 00:09:31.580
Accept it all... Don't let death
become everything to you.

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:36.890
If you do, your eyes...

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:44.700
Your heart...

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.170
No!

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:57.270
No!

00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:13.930
Hirose-sama?

00:10:14.600 --> 00:10:15.730
Hotaru-chan?

00:10:15.730 --> 00:10:17.290
Good...

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.720
Hey, Hirose's awake!

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:20.870
Really?

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:23.790
Jeez... You cause so much trouble...

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:25.410
I'm going home!

00:10:25.410 --> 00:10:27.390
I need to clean the fields.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:30.250
Hirose-sama, does it hurt anywhere?

00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:31.350
No...

00:10:31.350 --> 00:10:34.520
Good. I'll get something to drink.

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:35.220
I see...

00:10:35.220 --> 00:10:36.520
Um...

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:39.870
Um... I...

00:10:43.820 --> 00:10:45.290
I...

00:10:46.760 --> 00:10:48.090
My eyes...

00:10:49.690 --> 00:10:51.330
I can't see!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.110
Did you hear?

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:06.610
Hirose-kun's insisting he could see!

00:11:06.610 --> 00:11:07.570
No way!

00:11:07.570 --> 00:11:08.210
Really!

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:10.480
At school and at home, too!

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:14.210
That's impossible! He couldn't have!

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:15.430
Right?

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:17.890
I wonder what happened.

00:11:18.500 --> 00:11:21.290
There's no real change.

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:23.710
I can only assume that his desire
to see was so strong,

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:26.330
that he convinced himself he was seeing.

00:11:29.600 --> 00:11:32.000
Hey, Uncle...

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:34.580
That picture we took at the sea...

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:36.460
Wait, just a second.

00:11:38.580 --> 00:11:39.710
This?

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.020
Am in it?

00:11:44.020 --> 00:11:47.120
Yeah, right in the middle.

00:11:47.120 --> 00:11:48.100
My eyes?

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:50.750
They're open, right?

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:54.180
I saw this picture!

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:55.990
My eyes were open.

00:11:56.720 --> 00:11:58.960
Oh, right.

00:12:01.610 --> 00:12:03.940
11:02 AM.

00:12:03.940 --> 00:12:05.100
This is it.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:06.840
Look.

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:10.140
I took notes in class.

00:12:10.140 --> 00:12:12.610
I could see the blackboard.

00:12:13.520 --> 00:12:14.810
Tacky...

00:12:14.810 --> 00:12:15.610
You know...

00:12:15.610 --> 00:12:17.940
And I drew a picture, too.

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:21.420
11:03 AM.

00:12:20.500 --> 00:12:21.420
See?

00:12:21.420 --> 00:12:23.410
When we were all drawing pictures...

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:30.310
Tacky, lie down for a bit.

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:31.960
It's true!

00:12:31.960 --> 00:12:33.690
I could see, really!

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:36.800
Back then, too... I...

00:12:37.830 --> 00:12:39.670
<i>But I didn't peek...</i>

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:43.000
<i>Th-That's right.</i>

00:12:43.910 --> 00:12:45.210
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:12:47.230 --> 00:12:48.150
That was...

00:12:48.150 --> 00:12:52.730
Your friends said they'd come
over after school.

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:54.300
You always make the ladies cry...

00:12:54.300 --> 00:12:55.300
No.

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.300
I don't want to see them.

00:13:00.990 --> 00:13:02.670
I see.

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:05.660
I think he'll be better soon.

00:13:05.660 --> 00:13:06.530
Sorry.

00:13:06.530 --> 00:13:08.400
Jeez...

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:12.310
The great Yui-sama brought him
a fresh pumpkin, too!

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:13.800
I'll take it back!

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:15.720
It's heavy!

00:13:15.720 --> 00:13:17.170
Let's leave it here!

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:19.400
You blasphemers!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:20.540
Hayami-chan?

00:13:20.540 --> 00:13:21.830
Where's Hirose?

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:24.010
Where are you going?

00:13:24.010 --> 00:13:26.020
I'm going to go check my house.

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:29.050
I can't stay here forever.

00:13:29.050 --> 00:13:31.680
Don't worry about it.

00:13:31.680 --> 00:13:33.460
Your wounds haven't closed up yet.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:35.170
Heaven will punish you if you throw it away!

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:35.710
But I should at least look.

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:36.620
Then you...

00:13:35.710 --> 00:13:36.670
Okay.

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.900
carry it.

00:13:40.020 --> 00:13:41.670
It's not heavy!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.470
Grandfather!

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:46.500
I see you're all together.

00:13:46.500 --> 00:13:48.410
Do you need something?

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:52.420
I had something to talk to Hozumi-san about.

00:13:55.440 --> 00:13:58.180
I want to speak with you, too.

00:14:02.010 --> 00:14:05.260
So she's become a real member
of the household, then?

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:08.160
She's an important friend of Tacky's.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:13.830
Takuma-kun seems to be suffering a
good deal because of it, though.

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.280
Grandfather...

00:14:16.200 --> 00:14:21.100
I contacted Takuma-kun's family
regarding this matter.

00:14:21.100 --> 00:14:22.570
What?

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:28.450
Hirose-sama is quite worried
about Takuma-kun.

00:14:28.450 --> 00:14:30.540
He says that he doesn't want

00:14:30.540 --> 00:14:32.410
the Kohinatas also taking his grandson,

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.590
after they took his only daughter.

00:14:34.590 --> 00:14:40.520
And so, he wants her to leave.

00:14:40.520 --> 00:14:42.730
I won't let him!

00:14:42.730 --> 00:14:46.860
This is also the unanimous
decision of the village!

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:52.240
We're done with the Kohinatas.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.920
Very well.

00:14:53.920 --> 00:14:55.140
Then I will...

00:14:55.140 --> 00:14:57.170
Don't talk.

00:14:57.170 --> 00:15:01.140
Did you think you could speak to me?

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:02.350
Don't be so arrogant.

00:15:03.320 --> 00:15:04.580
Grandfather...

00:15:04.580 --> 00:15:07.280
You be silent.

00:15:14.550 --> 00:15:15.710
Hirose-sama!

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:19.330
Um, this was...

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:21.200
Are you okay?

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.230
Uncle?

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:26.580
Wasn't the bathroom this way?

00:15:26.580 --> 00:15:28.500
I don't know.

00:15:28.500 --> 00:15:29.770
I can't see anything.

00:15:29.770 --> 00:15:31.610
It's this way.

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:39.460
Demon... How many must you kill
before you're satisfied?

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:11.450
It's 3:08 AM.

00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:13.250
It's already night.

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:19.290
No, I've decided.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:22.290
But this late at night?

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:26.760
I might cause more trouble
for you tomorrow...

00:16:26.760 --> 00:16:27.930
Trouble? Not at all.

00:16:27.930 --> 00:16:29.900
Thank you...

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:31.100
Hey!

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:33.870
H-Hayami-chan.

00:16:34.440 --> 00:16:36.020
Hayami-chan!

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:42.750
Hayami-chan!

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:45.650
Wait a second!

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:46.380
Hey!

00:16:47.680 --> 00:16:49.150
Tacky!

00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:52.780
What are you doing?!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:58.370
Hayami-chan! Hayami-chan!
Hayami-chan! Hayami-chan!

00:16:57.100 --> 00:16:58.350
Just calm down...

00:16:58.370 --> 00:17:04.130
Hayami-chan! Hayami-chan! Hayami-chan!

00:17:06.560 --> 00:17:08.160
I can't...

00:17:29.850 --> 00:17:31.130
Hotaru-chan?

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:32.760
What are you doing out this late?

00:17:32.760 --> 00:17:33.990
Where's Hayami-chan?

00:17:33.990 --> 00:17:36.470
She just left...

00:17:36.470 --> 00:17:37.940
Why so late at night?

00:17:37.940 --> 00:17:40.160
Good timing... I'll look for her.

00:17:40.160 --> 00:17:41.640
Can you look after Tacky...

00:17:48.510 --> 00:17:50.220
Hirose-sama!

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:55.160
Please!

00:17:55.160 --> 00:17:57.770
Stop Hayami-chan!

00:17:57.770 --> 00:17:59.480
Hotaru-chan?

00:17:59.480 --> 00:18:01.350
She's going to leave the village!

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:05.430
She's going to vanish!

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.380
I can't.

00:18:08.380 --> 00:18:11.580
I don't know which way to go.

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:13.430
I don't know the way.

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:16.340
I don't know the direction...

00:18:17.900 --> 00:18:19.180
I can't do anything...

00:18:19.180 --> 00:18:22.290
Don't say that.

00:18:22.290 --> 00:18:25.780
But I never saw anything.

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:28.390
Everything I saw... Everything I thought...

00:18:28.390 --> 00:18:33.320
Everything I thought I did... It was all a lie.

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:36.260
Everything...

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:40.260
Maybe it's an illusion.

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.970
An illusion...

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:45.300
There's no Hinata-chan, no Hotaru-chan.

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:47.550
No Hayami-chan...

00:18:48.780 --> 00:18:49.940
Not even a village.

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:53.920
They're all figments I made up, in my mind.

00:18:54.880 --> 00:18:57.190
That's why it was so fun.

00:18:58.500 --> 00:19:01.980
That's why so many good things happened.

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:11.300
I'm not allowed to be happy...

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:20.740
There's no one who isn't allowed to be happy!

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:24.160
Not Hayami-chan... Or you, either!

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:32.130
That hurts...

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:34.480
It hurts.

00:19:37.330 --> 00:19:39.160
I'm sorry.

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:45.950
It is 4:02 AM.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:48.530
I'm sorry...

00:19:53.300 --> 00:19:54.540
Out of the way.

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:56.340
I'm leaving the village, just like you wanted.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.230
I don't know about that.

00:19:58.230 --> 00:20:01.040
You might come back.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:03.000
To destroy the village!

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:06.650
Once you've left the village,

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:08.800
no one will wonder what happened to you.

00:20:08.800 --> 00:20:11.920
Even if you go missing!

00:20:16.360 --> 00:20:17.890
Damn it!

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:18.900
After her!

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:36.080
I'm sorry.

00:20:40.960 --> 00:20:42.050
Wait.

00:20:42.050 --> 00:20:44.020
You can't run!

00:20:50.550 --> 00:20:51.900
I thought you'd come here.

00:20:58.100 --> 00:21:02.320
I'm told you're called "cockroach" at school.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.840
A nice name, if I do say so myself.

00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.860
You can step on them and step on them,

00:21:09.860 --> 00:21:12.520
and they keep harming the village.

00:21:17.690 --> 00:21:18.560
Do it.

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:29.870
What's wrong? Do it now!

00:21:37.150 --> 00:21:38.430
Did you get scared?

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:39.750
Fools!

00:21:47.430 --> 00:21:48.490
Die.

00:22:04.920 --> 00:22:06.740
I'm going to protect her.

00:22:08.230 --> 00:22:09.370
Hirose...

00:22:10.510 --> 00:22:12.230
I'm going to protect her.

00:22:13.160 --> 00:22:14.570
I'll protect her.

00:22:17.320 --> 00:22:18.780
My mother...

00:24:00.930 --> 00:24:02.850
Below the sky, I'd finally found...

00:24:02.850 --> 00:24:05.860
I keep running forever.

00:24:05.860 --> 00:24:07.730
I don't need anything.

00:24:07.730 --> 00:24:09.490
I don't need to reach anything.

00:24:09.490 --> 00:24:11.590
I don't need to see anything.

00:24:11.510 --> 00:24:15.100
<b>Twelfth Hour: H20</b>

00:24:11.590 --> 00:24:15.060
I have a place to go home to.
